# What this module needs from outside itself. Generated by dependencies-collect,
# do not edit. Each line is name | kind | locator | policy | consumer | reason,
# and then origin and origin detail, which are empty for a tool that states no
# origin of its own and is answered by DEPENDENCIES.map instead.
#
# This file is the whole contract with the layer above. The consumer column names
# the plugin that declared the line, or the plugin and the unit inside it where the
# declaration says which one wanted the tool, so to change a line, edit needs.tools
# in that plugin's manifest.lua and run this again.
